    "skyPreset": "golden_alpine_meadow",
    "loreSummary": "The only ground on Thirstwold carrying two settlements: the landmass has five, they stand on four regions, and two of them are here, twelve kilometres of road apart. One sits at the one spring on this ground and the other within reach of the crossing, and between them the work is wheat on the old river floor, cobble off the gravel fans, and salvage off the sand sea, which at forty-six kilometres is the largest drawn anywhere in the world."
  },
